---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../../components/FAQSchema.astro";
import ServiceVideoProof from "../../../components/ServiceVideoProof.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Upholstery Cleaning in Saint-Bruno | Sofa, Sectional, Fabric Furniture"
  description="Premium residential upholstery cleaning in Saint-Bruno for sofas, sectionals, modular seating, armchairs and banquettes. Meticulous care for quality furniture and light fabrics."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Sofa, Sectional and Upholstery Cleaning in Saint-Bruno</h1>
      <p>
        In Saint-Bruno, well-kept homes and established family households often feature quality upholstered furniture that deserves careful maintenance. Our service is
        designed to preserve comfort, protect light fabrics and deliver durable cleanliness with a refined residential finish.
      </p>
      <div class="upholstery-local-hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary pulse-btn" href="tel:5148939939">
          <span class="cta-btn-stack">
            <span>Call for a Fast Estimate</span>
            <span class="cta-btn-phone-num">(514) 893-9939</span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="btn btn-gradient-green"
          onclick="window.openEstimationWidget()"
        >
          Request a Free Estimate
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section svp-section-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <ServiceVideoProof
        title="See our upholstery cleaning in action"
        subtitle="Real example of in-home sofa cleaning"
        description="Watch a real job and see our professional method for cleaning upholstered furniture right in the client's home."
        youtubeId="auWtvSvqucg"
        youtubeTitle="Stained sofa cleaning in Saint-Bruno-de-Montarville"
        allVideosHref="/en/video-gallery/"
        videoAspectRatio="9 / 16"
        playLabel="Watch the video"
        allVideosLabel="See all our projects"
        closeLabel="Close video"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-light">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <h2>Local Service in Saint-Bruno</h2>
      <p>
        We provide in-home upholstery cleaning across Saint-Bruno with a precise workflow: detailed fabric inspection, method-specific product selection, deep extraction
        cleaning and careful finishing. The result is consistent appearance and long-term furniture preservation.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Routine Upholstery Cleaning Matters</h2>
      <p>
        Even in well-maintained interiors, upholstery gradually collects fine dust, body oils and daily-use residue. Professional cleaning on a regular basis helps
        maintain appearance, comfort and structural longevity of sofas, armchairs and banquette seating.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Professional Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fabric inspection and method validation before cleaning.</li>
        <li>Targeted pre-treatment with fiber-appropriate professional shampoo.</li>
        <li>Steam cleaning via hot water extraction with truck-mount power.</li>
        <li>Protection of floors and circulation areas.</li>
        <li>Precise extraction for fast drying, typically between 2 and 6 hours.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Furniture We Clean</h2>
      <p>
        We clean sectional sofas, modular sofas, loveseats, upholstered armchairs, banquettes, ottomans and fabric chairs. Each item is treated according to upholstery
        type, usage pattern and finish expectations.
      </p>

      <h2>Specialized Treatments Available</h2>
      <p>
        When needed, we can add targeted stain treatment, odor neutralization, enzymatic treatment and optional fabric protection. Recommendations are based on condition,
        with long-term furniture quality in mind.
      </p>

      <h2>Why Homeowners in Saint-Bruno Choose Empire</h2>
      <p>
        With over 30 years of experience, our team combines technical rigor, eco-friendly products and premium residential standards. We focus on durable cleanliness and
        meticulous execution for homes where details matter.
      </p>

      <h2>Saint-Bruno FAQ</h2>
      <FAQSchema
        faqs={[
          {
            question: "Is this service safe for light-colored upholstery in family homes?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We adapt every step to fiber type so we can clean deeply while protecting delicate or light upholstery finishes.",
          },
          {
            question: "Can you clean a large sectional and matching armchairs in one visit?",
            answer:
              "Yes. We organize the appointment to cover your primary seating set in a single service window with a consistent cleaning approach.",
          },
          {
            question: "How long before the furniture is fully dry?",
            answer:
              "Most upholstery dries within 2 to 6 hours, depending on fabric, ventilation and indoor humidity.",
          },
        ]}
      />

      <h2>Request an Estimate</h2>
      <p>
        For a quick quote on sofa, sectional, modular seating, armchair or banquette cleaning in Saint-Bruno, contact Empire Cleaning Group at (514) 893-9939.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta .cta-btn-stack {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    line-height: 1.25;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .upholstery-local-hero-cta .cta-btn-phone-num {
    font-size: 0.92em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
